sequenceDiagram
    actor P as Professor
    participant API as Express API
    participant MGR as QuizGenerationManager
    participant EXT as ContentExtractionService
    participant STO as LocalStorage
    participant AI as Gemini API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    P->>API: POST /materials/:id/generate-quiz
    API->>API: authenticate + authorize(professor)

    API->>MGR: generateFromMaterial(materialId, professorId)
    MGR->>DB: materialRepo.findById(materialId)
    DB-->>MGR: material record

    MGR->>MGR: verify professor owns material

    MGR->>STO: storage.read(material.fileKey)
    STO-->>MGR: file buffer

    MGR->>EXT: extractFromBuffer(buffer, mimeType)
    EXT->>EXT: parse PDF, extract text
    EXT-->>MGR: { text, pageCount }

    MGR->>AI: generateJson(prompt with content)
    Note over AI: Gemini generates quiz<br/>questions as JSON
    AI-->>MGR: raw JSON response

    MGR->>MGR: validate with Zod schema
    MGR->>MGR: verify correctAnswer in options

    MGR->>DB: quizRepo.create(quiz)
    DB-->>MGR: quiz record

    loop For each question
        MGR->>DB: quizRepo.addQuestion(...)
    end

    MGR-->>API: { generatedQuiz, savedQuiz }
    API-->>P: 201 Created
